[ti:Maṅgala Sutta]
[place:Mahamevnawa Buddhist Monastery]
[page:https://archive.org/details/mahamevnawapalisuttapitakachanting/KN+SN+24+Mangala+Sutta+(Chanting).mp3]
# Made from the recording's pauses with scripts/timings.ts, as described in TIMINGS.md.
# Two stretches of chanting are not in the chant and have no row: 00:01.74-00:04.94,
# before line 1, and 05:21.34-05:28.02, after line 55. They may be a title and a closing.
# Chants in recording order:
#   mangala-sutta

[chant:0051 mangala-sutta]
[00:05.76]1 Evam-me sutaṁ:
[00:09.81]2 ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā, sāvatthiyaṁ viharati, jeta-vane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme.
[00:26.59]3 Atha kho aññatarā devatā abhikkantāya rattiyā
[00:36.11]4 abhikkanta-vaṇṇā kevala-kappaṁ jetavanaṁ obhāsetvā,
[00:47.04]5 yena bhagavā ten'upasaṅkami.
[00:53.11]6 Upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekam-antaṁ aṭṭhāsi.
[01:05.58]7 Ekam-antaṁ ṭhitā kho sā devatā bhagavantaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi:
[01:18.53]8 Bahū devā manussā ca,
[01:24.06]9 Maṅgalāni acintayuṁ;
[01:29.16]10 Ākaṅkhamānā sotthānaṁ,
[01:34.75]11 Brūhi maṅgalam-uttamaṁ.
[01:39.74]12 Asevanā ca bālānaṁ
[01:44.72]13 Paṇḍitānañ-ca sevanā
[01:49.72]14 Pūjā ca pūjanīyānaṁ
[01:55.13]15 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[02:00.49]16 Paṭirūpa-desa-vāso ca
[02:05.88]17 Pubbe ca kata-puññatā
[02:10.69]18 Atta-sammā-paṇidhi ca
[02:15.31]19 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[02:20.28]20 Bāhu-saccañ-ca sippañ-ca,
[02:25.69]21 Vinayo ca susikkhito
[02:29.89]22 Subhāsitā ca yā vācā
[02:35.12]23 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[02:40.18]24 Mātā-pitu-upaṭṭhānaṁ
[02:45.42]25 Putta-dārassa saṅgaho
[02:50.19]26 Anākulā ca kammantā
[02:55.09]27 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[03:00.00]28 Dānañ-ca dhamma-cariyā ca
[03:05.35]29 Ñātakānañ-ca saṅgaho
[03:10.60]30 Anavajjāni kammāni
[03:15.54]31 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[03:20.61]32 Āratī viratī pāpā
[03:24.86]33 Majja-pānā ca saññamo
[03:29.98]34 Appamādo ca dhammesu
[03:35.17]35 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[03:40.33]36 Gāravo ca nivāto ca
[03:45.76]37 Santuṭṭhī ca kataññutā
[03:50.43]38 Kālena dhammassavanaṁ
[03:55.07]39 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:00.04]40 Khantī ca sovacassatā
[04:04.93]41 Samaṇānañ-ca dassanaṁ
[04:09.62]42 Kālena dhamma-sākacchā
[04:14.87]43 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:19.82]44 Tapo ca brahma-cariyañ-ca
[04:24.74]45 Ariya-saccāna-dassanaṁ
[04:29.43]46 Nibbāna-sacchikiriyā ca
[04:34.67]47 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:39.75]48 Phuṭṭhassa loka-dhammehi
[04:44.58]49 Cittaṁ yassa na kampati
[04:49.67]50 Asokaṁ virajaṁ khemaṁ
[04:54.48]51 Etam maṅgalam-uttamaṁ
[04:59.36]52 Etādisāni katvāna
[05:04.43]53 Sabbattham-aparājitā
[05:08.89]54 Sabbattha sotthiṁ gacchanti
[05:14.67]55 Tan-tesaṁ maṅgalam-uttaman'ti
[05:20.43]
